abstract: >-
  A deterministic synthetic fixture and scorer bundle for testing safeguard
  routing under ambiguity, untrusted context, prompt injection, disclosure
  boundaries, provenance constraints, and consequential-action gates. It is
  not a biological capability benchmark or real-world risk measurement.
